&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration with Product, Design, Data and Commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape how engineering teams adopt AI-native ways of working at scale &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will add value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through Engineering Managers and Tech Leads, coaching them as leaders and holding them accountable for team health, delivery, and technical quality. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical and architectural direction across your domain, ensuring designs are coherent, fit for purpose, and aligned to hipages’ standards. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the engineering quality bar across CI/CD, testing, observability, security, incident response, and operational health.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior Product and Design peers to shape domain strategy, challenge scope and sequencing, and ensure engineering effort is invested where it creates the greatest customer and commercial impact. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end delivery across multiple teams, including planning, execution, dependencies, risks, and measurable outcomes. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a clear technical roadmap that balances architecture, operational health, and feature delivery. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and manage cross-team risks early, including dependencies outside your domain. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams have clear, measurable OKRs that ladder up to coherent domain outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead AI-forward ways of working by helping teams understand how AI changes throughput, team shape, roles, skills, and product opportunities. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years’ experience in engineering leadership, including at least 3 years leading multiple teams or Engineering Managers, ideally in a product-led technology business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead delivery through outcomes, not process, and are comfortable applying modern agile principles at multi-team scale without relying on a rigid framework. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation and can earn the respect of senior engineers, challenge architectural decisions, and make credible build, buy, or defer recommendations. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing Engineering Managers, not just engineers, and you enjoy multiplying your impact through the leaders below you. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have navigated, or are actively navigating, the shift to AI-augmented engineering and understand how AI changes team shape, throughput expectations, and engineering craft. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate with credibility across senior stakeholders and can translate technical complexity into business stakes without oversimplifying. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring strong commercial judgement and can connect engineering investment to customer and business outcomes. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable prioritising ruthlessly when resources are constrained and can explain the trade-offs clearly. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
