&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;60 minute High level System Design round with one of our Engineering Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;60 minute Panel Interview with 2 of our Head of Engineering leaders, 30 minutes focused on a technical deep dive into your CV and into a project/system you built in the past. 30 minutes will be focused on testing for leadership attributes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;60 minute Stakeholder Management Round with one of our Product Heads/VPs, focused on your stakeholder management, collaboration skills with product/business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;60 minute Technical round and Culture fit interview with our Co-founder &amp;amp; Group CTO (the hiring manager).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
