&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android (Kotlin, Java) - primary platform for all POS application development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EMV payment standards and PCI/P2PE certification frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple POS device types and OEM manufacturers, including Topwise and Telpo&lt;/li&gt;
