&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 1: A preliminary phone call with one of our recruiters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 2: Technical Round focused on core technical strengths and depth in Android/Kotlin&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 3: System Design - You will be asked to solve complex system design problems to assess your technical and architectural skills, with a particular focus on POS and mobile platform architecture and payment systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 4: Technical and Architectural Leadership - An interview with one Head of Engineering focused on leadership skills and attributes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stage 5: CTO Interview - A conversation with our CTO assessing first-principles thinking, problem-solving under ambiguity, clarity of thought, and cultural alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
