&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a customer-facing role, including 3+ years of experience in project management, implementation, or onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple complex projects simultaneously across competing priorities, timelines, and resources.&lt;/li&gt;
