&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Provide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; technical leadership across the Storage Services group for &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Block, File, Parallel, and Object storage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; the design of scalable, resilient, and high-performance storage solutions aligned with Nscale’s wider platform architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
