&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; the roadmap by clarifying technical trade-offs, platform dependencies, and long-term architectural considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
